    j0_m1:['Welding head module','Instrumentation Workbench, Station Modules blueprint: 6 steel plates, 3 steel components, 2 vacuum tubes, 1 graphite electrode, 6 copper wires; later the station itself.','Utility: welding power source and 2 argon cylinders.'],
    j0_m2:['Press actuator module','Instrumentation Workbench, Station Modules blueprint: 9 steel plates, 3 steel components, 2 vacuum tubes, 2 pistons; later the station itself.','Utility: hydraulic power unit.'],
