    j1_m1:['Welding head module','Instrumentation Workbench, Station Modules blueprint: 6 steel plates, 3 steel components, 2 vacuum tubes, 1 graphite electrode, 6 copper wires; later the station itself.','Utility: welding power source and 2 argon cylinders.'],
    j1_m8:['Nondestructive inspection module','Instrumentation Workbench, Station Modules blueprint: 6 lead plates, 3 steel components, 3 vacuum tubes, 1 circuit board, 1 uranium ingot; later the station itself.','Utility: shielded source safe.'],
    j1_m2:['Press actuator module','Instrumentation Workbench, Station Modules blueprint: 9 steel plates, 3 steel components, 2 vacuum tubes, 2 pistons; later the station itself.','Utility: hydraulic power unit.'],
    j2:['Electronics jig','Instrumentation Workbench, Jigs blueprint: 4 steel plates, 2 steel components, 2 circuit boards.','Tells the station which line it works for; it takes the 5 modules beside it.'],
    j2_m0:['Robotic arm module','Instrumentation Workbench, Station Modules blueprint: 6 steel plates, 3 steel components, 2 vacuum tubes, 1 circuit board, 3 steel rods; later the station itself.','Utility: controller cabinet with its teach pendant.'],
